id=vddropbear
name=VD Dropbear
version=v1.01
versionCode=10001
author=VD171
description=Standalone, fully configurable Dropbear SSH server for KernelSU/APatch/Magisk. Independent of any other module. Port, binds, host keys, authorized keys, passwords, a hidden version banner and BFU/AFU start behaviour are all set from the WebUI. WARNING: logins default to a ROOT shell.
